   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">2.1 Number of low-income direct consumers targeted to access and utilize new or enhanced products/services that impact on their basic human needs as a result of the Growth Accelerator Programme</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low-income urban and Peri-urban consumers that transition from use of illegal charcoal to the use of legal charcoal &#x201c;capacity&#x201d; is defined as ability and potential of a business to scale. The team will demonstrate that it is able to learn with and fully apply the programme content and resources to grow their venture. They have what it takes to grow the business to its potential. This includes recruiting the right additional resources when the business requires it.</narrative>
    </description>
